1
00:00:01,166 --> 00:00:04,125
Part Three: Supportive Measures

2
00:00:04,750 --> 00:00:08,375
If you do experience weight
loss due to difficulty with nutrition,

3
00:00:08,833 --> 00:00:11,458
we can help with supportive measures.

4
00:00:11,458 --> 00:00:14,625
First,
we can make adjustments to your diet

5
00:00:14,625 --> 00:00:18,916
by adding foods that are easier
to consume, such as softer foods.

6
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:22,750
Our dietitian will help
you look at pureed food

7
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:25,833
or soft foods that are dense in nutrition.

8
00:00:26,583 --> 00:00:30,333
Second,
we have numbing agents such as lidocaine

9
00:00:30,333 --> 00:00:33,333
to soften
the pain caused by swallowing food.

10
00:00:33,916 --> 00:00:38,708
Lidocaine, which you can rinse around
in your mouth and swallow, also known as

11
00:00:38,708 --> 00:00:41,750
rinse and swallow,
will numb your mouth and throat

12
00:00:41,916 --> 00:00:44,916
for about 15 to 20 minutes.

13
00:00:44,916 --> 00:00:49,375
This short window provides you
an opportunity to eat as much as you can,

14
00:00:49,625 --> 00:00:53,416
with the decrease in pain
caused by irritating the inflamed tissues

15
00:00:53,416 --> 00:00:55,166
of the mouth and throat.
